#: src/sshpilot/window_dialogs.py:1991
msgid "Replace mode will overwrite the Default user SSH configuration entirely. That configuration is shared with ssh, scp, git and other SSH tools; unmanaged Host, Include and Match rules may be lost. Choose Merge instead to add hosts without overwriting."
